Read back the highlights made in Marginalia, on one item or on every item sent there. Highlights made in mxr are never changed

Usage: mxr reading marginalia sync [OPTIONS] [ITEM]

Arguments:
  [ITEM]

Options:
      --account <ACCOUNT>  Limit to one account; the default covers every account
      --format <FORMAT>    [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help               Print help
